        "suggestion": 0
      },
      "summary": "The tests cover several parser and supervision behaviors, but none verifies that Parse deletes its temporary working directory after the worker exits, as required by AC-4.",
      "findingList": [
        {
          "severity": "major",
          "file": "backend/AirlineDemo.Api.Tests/IsolatedPdfParserTests.cs",
          "line": 218,
          "message": "AC-4's temporary working directory cleanup is untested. Add a test that verifies Parse removes the directory it creates after the worker run.",
          "confidence": 0.96,
          "category": "testing",
          "evidence": {
            "codePathTraced": "WorkingDirectory_IsFreshPerRunUnderTempPath checks that ChooseWorkingDirectory returns unique, nonexistent paths. Child_StartsWithEmptyEnvironmentAndReadOnlyWorkingDirectory creates and deletes its own directory; neither test checks cleanup of the directory Parse creates.",
            "failureScenario": "If Parse stops deleting its temporary working directory after the worker exits, these tests still pass. AC-4's cleanup behavior therefore lacks a regression test."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
